Comment: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:39.97,Default,Book,0000,0000,0000,,Part Time Jobs
Comment: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:39.97,Default,Book,0000,0000,0000,,Help-Wanted Information
Comment: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:39.97,Default,Book,0000,0000,0000,,To the Cutting Edge of Progress!
Comment: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:39.97,Default,Book,0000,0000,0000,,Low Fuel Consumption! Low Price!!
Comment: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:44.92,Default,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,European Style Sweets     Tirol
Comment: 0,0:01:01.33,0:01:03.87,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:23:00.42,0:23:12.93,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:05.43,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.43,0:00:06.98,Default,Child,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:10.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,See you on Monday!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:17.78,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Why you... Every single time...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:19.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.07,0:00:21.08,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, just move outta the way. I'm going to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to another job?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:24.37,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.32,0:00:41.88,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! Thank you for your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.88,0:00:44.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything else I can help with?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.51,0:00:47.34,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be okay here. You can go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:39.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There are so many different kinds of part time jobs, aren't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.97,0:02:43.18,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going to do with that book? Oww.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.56,0:02:47.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Get a job of course! Just like Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:50.35,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,'Cause you wanna help pay back even\Njust a little of the nursery's debt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:51.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:58.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I could deliver newspapers bright and early in the morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:00.58,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you oversleep every morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:05.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Well then... 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.81,0:03:09.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How about delivering pizza to people's houses?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.85,0:03:11.90,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You're definitely the type who would get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.96,0:03:17.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.79,0:03:21.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How about helping people move?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.39,0:03:23.68,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You'd just break things and make a mess in general.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.30,0:03:29.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then what kind of job should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:31.42,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ask me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:35.32,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:37.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:40.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:42.36,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Yes? {Coming!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:46.86,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,He has a rip!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:48.16,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Poor doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:49.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:50.66,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:54.04,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go, all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:55.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:56.49,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:03:59.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, there's something else I wanted to ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.85,0:04:06.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The umbrella person!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:08.18,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're the one from...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.47,0:04:10.95,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much for the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.95,0:04:11.63,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.63,0:04:13.81,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you already know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:14.78,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:17.69,Default,Man,0000,0000,0000,,It's nice to formally meet you. I'm the manager, Ueda.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.69,0:04:19.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kobato Hanato!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:25.95,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato is a tenant at my apartment and\Nshe always helps out at Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:31.08,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,She said she was looking for a place to work and your shop came to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.29,0:04:32.91,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:37.74,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,It's very busy here so if she could work even just on the weekends, it'd help me out immensely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:39.30,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,At least until my hands heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:42.60,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,They're in bad shape right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:45.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:48.05,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really clumsy, see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.77,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,She hurt herself just recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.77,0:04:53.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.73,0:04:57.83,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. But when it gets busy here, it's hard for the manager to take care of everything himself... 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:05:00.44,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be counting on you then, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:04.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'll do my best, Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:06.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And, umm... 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:10.49,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Yumi Omura. I look forward to working with you, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:15.24,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:16.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:22.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I finished changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:28.69,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,The uniform fits perfectly! I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:31.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And now, what should I do to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:37.21,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Well... First, when a customer\Narrives, be sure to greet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:38.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:40.66,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, just like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.66,0:05:41.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:46.46,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,And when you get an order, put the cake inside one of those boxes over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:47.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,These, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:51.11,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be working the register, so when the customer pays, make sure you say... 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.11,0:05:53.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:55.08,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.33,0:05:57.41,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:05:59.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:01.50,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's try, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:02.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:09.97,Default,Customer,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have... a shortcake and a Mont Blanc... and... 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:15.56,Default,Customer,0000,0000,0000,,Not a cheesecake, but... an apple pie... and a lemon tart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:11.89,Default Alt,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Shortcake and Mont Blanc...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.89,0:06:15.47,Default Alt,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Cheese, apple... lemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:16.89,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:19.31,Default,Customer,0000,0000,0000,,And a cream puff please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:21.63,Default,Customer,0000,0000,0000,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:26.47,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Shortcake, Mont Blanc, apple pie, lemon tart, and a cream puff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.47,0:06:28.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're amazing, Yumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:30.22,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Now, put those in a box, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.22,0:06:31.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:34.32,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, shortcake and—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.19,0:06:36.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:39.08,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, calm down. Get a different one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.08,0:06:40.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.59,0:06:45.71,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:47.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.00,0:06:53.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And now a Mont Blanc and...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:57.02,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,An apple pie and a lemon tart. And a cream puff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.85,0:07:03.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:06.82,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Then when you're all finished... 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.86,0:07:11.57,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:13.78,Default,Customer,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you as well, Miss Cheerful Shop Attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:18.57,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Was that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:21.79,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yup. Once you get used to it, I'm sure you'll be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.79,0:07:23.37,Default,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.37,0:07:23.79,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.06,0:07:25.79,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.79,0:07:27.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's Marina and her mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.09,0:07:30.16,Default,Mother,0000,0000,0000,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:32.77,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato works in a cake shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.77,0:07:35.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yup! Today I'm working in this cake shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.26,0:07:36.43,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:37.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of cake would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:41.39,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,We came to pick up my birthday cake today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.65,0:07:43.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's your birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.98,0:07:45.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:47.88,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, come wrap this up for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.88,0:07:48.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:53.62,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:54.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:08:00.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here you are. Sorry for the wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:03.29,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:05.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:06.42,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:14.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:16.00,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.55,0:08:19.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:22.10,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,It must've been switched by accident...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:24.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go see if I can catch Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:26.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.41,0:08:31.07,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:33.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:35.67,Default,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:37.00,Default,Customer,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have this one and this one please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:37.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:41.96,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Ah Kobato, this customer ordered\Nthe Mont Blanc and the cheesecake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:43.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:49.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.99,0:08:52.34,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you did well today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:55.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You were wonderful, Yumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.02,0:08:57.05,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go, a present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:08:59.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:01.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi will be so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.33,0:09:02.24,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Io...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.24,0:09:04.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He looks like a stuffed animal to everyone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:07.86,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be counting on you tomorrow as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:10.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can come in tomorrow too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:12.58,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:14.90,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi, you can go home now too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.89,0:09:17.66,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,But what about cleaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.01,0:09:22.99,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,I'll handle it. Your hands haven't\Nhealed yet, don't overwork yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.88,0:09:25.98,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.65,0:09:30.50,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll be going, Manager—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:38.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be heading off now, good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:41.44,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, and good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:48.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:51.92,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Oh, no, it's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:55.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But you look like you're\Nworried about something... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:59.62,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just thinking about the manager... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:01.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,About the manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:03.66,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like he's worried about something...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:09.67,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I asked him about it once, but he said nothing was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.91,0:10:11.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:13.82,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, the store is doing well and everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:17.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then I wonder what he could be worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:20.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think it could be loans?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.17,0:10:24.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Nursery is having a\Nproblem paying back its loans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.19,0:10:28.56,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Is that why you started working at Tirol?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:29.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:30.44,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,That's so nice of you... 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:36.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all. Both Fujimoto and Miss\NSayaka work so much harder than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.81,0:10:39.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I hope that I can help them out even just a little bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.21,0:10:46.45,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Me too... I wish I could help out the manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:52.29,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This is really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.85,0:10:57.79,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It must be painful to want to help\Nsomeone but not being able to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:01.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll find out what's bothering the manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:03.60,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I guess that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:06.29,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But if you do something\Nwrong, you might lose the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:08.43,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And then I won't be able to eat this delicious cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:12.44,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But then again... You could\Nalways work at other places.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.10,0:11:15.32,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,At a sushi shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:17.53,Default,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,At a steakhouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.45,0:11:20.32,Default,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,A high class Chinese restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.59,0:11:23.86,Default,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, what kind of job are you gonna get next?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.86,0:11:26.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to continue working at the bakery!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.63,0:11:32.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:35.23,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.23,0:11:37.01,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:39.57,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Could you line these cookies up on the shelf?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.57,0:11:39.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:49.54,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,All right, then I'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:54.46,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Did the manager just look at me and sigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:56.57,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He did?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:11:57.98,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why... 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:02.81,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Does whatever the manager is worried about have something to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.36,0:12:23.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go and ask what's bothering the manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.45,0:12:25.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:26.79,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.79,0:12:29.39,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Could you just casually ask him what's the matter then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.23,0:12:32.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:49.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:51.13,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:53.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes... Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.25,0:12:56.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There's something I wanted to casually ask you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.11,0:12:58.42,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato... 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:01.26,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:05.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you worried about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.75,0:13:10.53,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,No, there's nothing. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.53,0:13:16.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But Yumi said that it seems like there's something on your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.15,0:13:17.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,like there's something on the tip of your tongue... 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:19.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You've just been kinda strange lately!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.28,0:13:23.98,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing that Yumi needs to be worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:26.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And that's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:29.11,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,But that just makes me even more concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:32.55,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.55,0:13:34.42,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:36.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.06,0:13:37.39,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:40.59,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,She's helping out here until my hands heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:42.39,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.39,0:13:44.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you here to buy a cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:48.34,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to visit Chitose; I thought it'd be nice to buy her a little something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.45,0:13:52.35,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while since I've\Ngotten anything from Tirol.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:57.85,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,If I remember correctly, you ordered a birthday cake for your husband here before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.49,0:14:00.32,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:10.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka's... husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:12.78,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The man she got married to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:15.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I've never seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:17.46,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, maybe they broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.35,0:14:24.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka seemed very lonely...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.79,0:14:28.43,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't something you can just ask about directly, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:30.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.31,0:14:32.94,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,There are some things people just don't want to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.49,0:14:37.91,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You're hiding the fact that you're working part time to help the nursery, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.91,0:14:40.94,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,People don't just go about telling others everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.76,0:14:46.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if the manager at Tirol is the same way...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.69,0:14:50.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But Yumi really wants to know... 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.58,0:14:53.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What should someone do in that situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:56.33,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,See if they can investigate secretly I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:14:59.87,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That's something that you're not suited for though, Dobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.64,0:15:02.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I'll still try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:08.11,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:14.65,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This is definitely... secretly I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:16.02,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:18.12,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:19.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm doing a secret investigation!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.77,0:15:21.29,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.29,0:15:22.52,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,You're like a detective!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:24.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.15,0:15:30.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So this is a detective!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.43,0:15:32.11,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,Yup. That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.41,0:15:34.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They investigate a lot of things, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.59,0:15:37.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Like motives and alibis and evidence...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:41.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And they do searches and get information and tail people!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:42.57,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:44.17,Default,C,0000,0000,0000,,We'll help too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:48.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, a detective acts alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.61,0:15:50.05,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:53.41,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Somehow, this has gotten completely off track.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.83,0:15:56.74,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.78,0:16:01.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:05.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm being a detective for today and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:07.71,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:10.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Did you notice anything strange at Tirol?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:11.80,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,No, not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:13.66,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Has there been some sort of incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:17.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! The "manager is troubled" incident!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.45,0:16:18.96,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,The manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.96,0:16:20.16,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Is troubled?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.42,0:16:22.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Would you happen to know anything about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:24.59,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Asking us really won't... 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.59,0:16:25.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Anything at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:28.58,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,The cakes at Tirol are really popular...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.58,0:16:30.44,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I can't think of anything outside of work-related matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.44,0:16:31.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I see... 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.63,0:16:33.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:36.57,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,W-We'll be on our way then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:40.53,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't deal with this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.53,0:16:42.39,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my own dragnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.01,0:16:44.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Dragnet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.13,0:16:46.52,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.89,0:16:48.52,Default,Bear,0000,0000,0000,,You think I'd accept something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.79,0:16:50.28,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Stingy, aren't you, Genko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.70,0:16:53.69,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,If this is about love advice,\Ntake your business elsewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.69,0:16:57.07,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'll be taking my\Npresent and leaving I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:17:00.96,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,You just came to eat my baumkuchen, didn't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:02.18,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, someone's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:02.79,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:03.79,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.80,0:17:06.63,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.20,0:17:14.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:16.52,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.52,0:17:17.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:18.96,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.96,0:17:20.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Detective work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.40,0:17:22.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The things I've discovered so far are:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:24.11,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Tirol's cakes are very popular,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:27.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,and the manager's worries are probably work-related.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.54,0:17:34.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I've also found out that the manager always gives out chocolate to little children,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:36.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,asks about people's health,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:42.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,and that the people all love the\Ncakes made by the nice manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:45.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I even managed to get\Nsome chocolate by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:48.31,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,The manager really is nice to everyone isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.01,0:17:59.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi, this is the part where we tail him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:12.46,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, it's fine, we should stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:13.34,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:15.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.16,0:18:16.87,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.79,0:18:24.91,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if he's waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.57,0:18:30.25,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I know it's wrong to follow people like this, but... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:31.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Someone's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:36.92,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder who she is... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:39.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.98,0:18:40.98,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:44.58,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Is this... a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:47.17,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,That's probably why he couldn't tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.17,0:18:48.74,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:50.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down, Yumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:52.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be noticed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.71,0:18:53.32,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.55,0:18:58.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.23,0:19:05.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.62,0:19:06.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.94,0:19:08.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.33,0:19:10.50,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.71,0:19:12.96,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.58,0:19:15.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.27,0:19:18.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But the person that you were just with... 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:22.72,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,I was actually... interviewing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.26,0:19:26.14,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,A new employee for the store...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:27.58,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,A new employee?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.58,0:19:28.73,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:33.21,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato is able to come and help out on the weekends now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:36.48,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,But I've never been able to give you any time off, Yumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:37.69,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Time off?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.73,0:19:40.61,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,I was afraid that you were really tired,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.61,0:19:43.74,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,and I was thinking that you\Ngot injured because of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.13,0:19:45.61,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Manager...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.61,0:19:47.74,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,So that's what you were worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.99,0:19:48.79,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.74,0:19:52.51,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,You always work so hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.07,0:19:55.33,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,so I felt that I was taking advantage of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.87,0:19:57.21,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,And I felt terrible about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.47,0:20:01.80,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I do it because I like working together with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.76,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care if I don't get time off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.11,0:20:08.77,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I like seeing the happy faces of the\Ncustomers who come and buy Tirol's cakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:11.49,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,and I like being able to see you everyday!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.49,0:20:14.24,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,And... my injury is because...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.49,0:20:16.49,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:23.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:25.37,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,You... made this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.62,0:20:26.84,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:31.91,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I've been learning how to make cakes. That's why I have so many injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.91,0:20:37.36,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to help you out, even just a little, so I've been studying... 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:40.08,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.36,0:20:44.26,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Do you mind if I try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:47.26,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:02.53,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.53,0:21:03.66,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.49,0:21:07.73,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,I've managed to hire a new employee for the store,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.73,0:21:11.45,Default,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,so from now on, let's devote time to practicing making cakes together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.93,0:21:13.75,Default,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.66,0:21:24.39,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What, you actually managed to solve things?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.39,0:21:27.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Detective Kobato, case closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:31.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The manager wanted to make sure Yumi had time off to rest...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.28,0:21:37.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi wanted to be of more help to the manager...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.26,0:21:42.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It was a beautiful case in which the two of them were only thinking of the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.86,0:21:44.83,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That's good I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.83,0:21:46.49,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I got to eat more baumkuchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:49.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That baumkuchen isn't from Tirol, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.36,0:21:54.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And before, you brought\Nback a present, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.40,0:21:58.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if that present has\Nsomething to do with your dragnet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.17,0:22:00.67,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, that's right! Your score for this time, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.26,0:22:03.63,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You get a sweet 100 points because I got to eat cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.37,0:22:05.93,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.57,0:22:09.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.71,0:22:10.45,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.45,0:22:11.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I have a present for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.35,0:22:15.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's chocolate from the store that I'm working at now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:17.81,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Work? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:24.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll work hard too, so you try to rest a little and go to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:29.32,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You working hard isn't exactly music for my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.19,0:22:33.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Meanie...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:34.99,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.81,0:22:40.83,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't push yourself too hard and collapse or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.34,0:22:45.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Could you possibly be worrying about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:46.75,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.75,0:22:48.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.45,0:22:51.06,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever, do something about that writing on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.06,0:22:52.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is my 100 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.36,0:22:54.20,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about? It's just a scribbling, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.20,0:22:55.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.38,0:22:57.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You only get 50 points because you're a meanie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.87,0:22:59.19,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I don't get you at all.
