Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:11.87,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:16.46,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:20.47,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.70,0:01:23.27,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:30.61,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.03,0:01:36.19,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.98,0:01:40.03,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:43.57,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.82,0:01:46.63,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:49.37,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.62,0:01:54.62,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:57.43,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:02:01.02,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.05,0:02:03.78,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:06.52,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:13.40,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.69,0:02:17.41,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:22.06,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
